Testing is performed to make sure the application works correctly.

Test Cases
Test	Expected Result
Select Home Decor	Home Decor options should appear
Select Event Planning	Event Planning options should appear
Select Jewelry Shopping	Jewelry options should appear
Enter ₹50,000 budget	Recommendations should be generated
Enter budget below ₹500	Error message should appear
Select Best Quality	Higher-rated items should be considered
Select Lowest Price	Lower-priced suitable items should be considered
Change recommended item	Budget should be recalculated
Budget exceeds requirement	Remaining balance should be shown
Budget is insufficient	System should warn the user

The application validates that the budget must be at least ₹500.
